<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Brooks revenue outlook up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Brooks revenue outlook up.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- EVEREN Securities Inc said Wednesday it revised its revenue expectations on Brooks Fiber Properties Inc for 1997 to $134 million from $128 million.</p>
<p>-- EVEREN said Brooks reported better-than-expected 1996 Q4 results on Tuesday. &quot;We continue to recommend purchase of the common shares of Brooks based on our 18-month price target of $51,&quot; noted analyst Todd Scott in a report.</p>
<p>-- Brooks Fiber was off 1/8 at 21-5/8.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
